Grant write-mode git housekeeping to run_command

Allow git add, restore --staged, rm --cached, commit, and bounded
commit --amend only when write tools are active. Read-only mode keeps
its existing allowlist. Bounds amend to HEAD-only and rejects
author/date/fixup flags. Wire hanihi-cli --write and hanihi-eval
write_tools to the write variant.

